              <h4 class="vd-feature__details-title">Multiple connectivity options<sup><a href="#desc-section" class="click_sup" title="See disclaimer" data-sup="7">7</a></sup></h4>
              <p class="vd-feature__details-description">Featuring the connections creators need, including USB-C,
                Thunderbolt, DisplayPort and LAN ports. The ViewFinity series easily connects to external devices and
                accessories in the workspace.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="vd-feature__details-image">
